{"id": "4680341e-c58d-4a67-b5d0-ba241306c9a4", "slug": "aura-design-system", "title": "Aura Design System", "description": "Design System Form Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Aura Design System\"\ndescription: \"Design System Form Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#14B8A6\"\n  secondary: \"#042F2E\"\n  accent: \"#042F2E\"\n  background: \"#E5E7EB\"\n  surface: \"#042F2E\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aura Design System\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 2; favorites: 3; remixes: 3.\nTags: form, css, interactive, input, validation.\n## Overview\nDesign System Form Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\naura System Foundations Aura Visual Guide 2024 Architecture Index 01/ Core Logic 05/ Typography 02/ Grid Systems 06/ Components 03/ Color Science 07/ Motion Logic 04/ Iconography Philosophy We design interfaces that tra…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: System Foundations; Architecture Index; Philosophy; Rules of Engagement; Function over form; Scalable by default.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #14B8A6, secondary #042F2E, accent #042F2E, background #E5E7EB, surface #042F2E, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aura Design System</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <!-- Three.js for WebGL Animation -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r134/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            50: '#f0fdfa',\n                            100: '#ccfbf1',\n                            500: '#14b8a6', // Teal main accent\n                            900: '#134e4a',\n                            950: '#042f2e', // Deep dark background\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<!-- Outer gray background simulating the table the document sits on -->\n<body class=\"bg-[#e5e7eb] font-sans text-slate-800 antialiased min-h-screen p-4 md:p-8 lg:p-12 overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n    <!-- Main Grid Container holding the \"Pages\" -->\n    <main class=\"max-w-[1600px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 items-start\">\n\n        <!-- PAGE 1: HERO COVER (Takes up 1 column on large screens, or full width on small) -->\n        <section class=\"lg:col-span-1 relative bg-brand-950 rounded-sm shadow-xl overflow-hidden aspect-[1/1.4] min-h-[600px] flex flex-col justify-between group animate-fade-in-up\" style=\"animation: fade-in-up 0.8s ease-out forwards; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">\n            <!-- WebGL Canvas Background -->\n            <canvas id=\"hero-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-60\"></canvas>\n\n            <!-- Cover Content overlay -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 p-8 flex flex-col h-full justify-between pointer-events-none\">\n                <!-- Header/Logo -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-white\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight\">aura</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Title Area with Subtle Bottom Gradient -->\n                <div class=\"space-y-2 mt-auto pb-4\">\n                    <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-white font-semibold tracking-tight leading-[1.1]\">\n                        System<br>Foundations\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"text-brand-100 text-sm font-light mt-2\">Aura Visual Guide 2024</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Gradient overlay matching reference style -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-1/2 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-500/80 via-brand-900/40 to-transparent mix-blend-overlay pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- RIGHT SIDE: Nested Grid for inner pages -->\n        <div class=\"lg:col-span-2 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n\n            <!-- PAGE 2: INDEX (Content Tables) -->\n            <section class=\"bg-white rounded-sm shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden aspect-[1/1.4] min-h-[600px] flex flex-col animate-fade-in-up\" style=\"animation: fade-in-up 0.8s ease-out 0.2s forwards; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">\n                <!-- Architectural Grid Lines -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none border-x border-slate-100 mx-8\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none border-y border-slate-100 my-24\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-8 relative z-10 flex-grow flex flex-col\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-12\">Architecture Index</h2>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-3 mt-8 flex-grow content-start\">\n                        <!-- Index Item with Premium Border Gradient -->\n                        <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-sm group cursor-pointer\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500/0 via-brand-500/40 to-brand-500/0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 rounded-sm\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"relative bg-white border border-slate-200 group-hover:border-transparent px-3 py-2 text-xs flex justify-between items-center transition-all duration-300\">\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-medium\">01/</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-700 w-full ml-3 group-hover:text-brand-500 transition-colors\">Core Logic</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-sm group cursor-pointer\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500/0 via-brand-500/40 to-brand-500/0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 rounded-sm\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"relative bg-white border border-slate-200 group-hover:border-transparent px-3 py-2 text-xs flex justify-between items-center transition-all duration-300\">\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-medium\">05/</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-700 w-full ml-3 group-hover:text-brand-500 transition-colors\">Typography</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                         <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-sm group cursor-pointer\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500/0 via-brand-500/40 to-brand-500/0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 rounded-sm\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"relative bg-white border border-slate-200 group-hover:border-transparent px-3 py-2 text-xs flex justify-between items-center transition-all duration-300\">\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-medium\">02/</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-700 w-full ml-3 group-hover:text-brand-500 transition-colors\">Grid Systems</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-sm group cursor-pointer\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500/0 via-brand-500/40 to-brand-500/0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 rounded-sm\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"relative bg-white border border-slate-200 group-hover:border-transparent px-3 py-2 text-xs flex justify-between items-center transition-all duration-300\">\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-medium\">06/</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-700 w-full ml-3 group-hover:text-brand-500 transition-colors\">Components</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-sm group cursor-pointer\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500/0 via-brand-500/40 to-brand-500/0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 rounded-sm\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"relative bg-white border border-slate-200 group-hover:border-transparent px-3 py-2 text-xs flex justify-between items-center transition-all duration-300\">\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-medium\">03/</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-700 w-full ml-3 group-hover:text-brand-500 transition-colors\">Color Science</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-sm group cursor-pointer\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500/0 via-brand-500/40 to-brand-500/0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 rounded-sm\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"relative bg-white border border-slate-200 group-hover:border-transparent px-3 py-2 text-xs flex justify-between items-center transition-all duration-300\">\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-medium\">07/</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-700 w-full ml-3 group-hover:text-brand-500 transition-colors\">Motion Logic</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-sm group cursor-pointer\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500/0 via-brand-500/40 to-brand-500/0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 rounded-sm\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"relative bg-white border border-slate-200 group-hover:border-transparent px-3 py-2 text-xs flex justify-between items-center transition-all duration-300\">\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-medium\">04/</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-700 w-full ml-3 group-hover:text-brand-500 transition-colors\">Iconography</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- PAGE 3: INTRODUCTION (Split Layout) -->\n            <section class=\"bg-white rounded-sm shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden aspect-[1/1.4] min-h-[600px] flex flex-col animate-fade-in-up\" style=\"animation: fade-in-up 0.8s ease-out 0.4s forwards; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">\n                <!-- Split Grid Column Line -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-[35%] w-[1px] bg-slate-100 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex h-full relative z-10\">\n                    <!-- Left Col: Text -->\n                    <div class=\"w-[35%] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                        <div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-brand-500 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-8\">Philosophy</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed\">\n                                We design interfaces that translate complex technical capabilities into intuitive human experiences. Aura operates at the intersection of deep engineering and refined aesthetics.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium\">01</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Right Col: Graphic (Simulating the dithered building in reference) -->\n                    <div class=\"w-[65%] relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-50/50 flex items-end justify-center group\">\n                        <!-- Abstract CSS Geometric Art replacing the building -->\n                        <div class=\"w-[80%] h-[70%] relative flex flex-col justify-end items-center gap-2 pb-8 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\">\n                            <!-- Utilizing border gradients for the geometric shapes -->\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-1/3 relative p-[1px] rounded-sm\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-500/30 to-transparent rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"relative w-full h-full bg-white border border-brand-100/50 backdrop-blur-sm\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-3/4 h-1/4 relative p-[1px] rounded-sm\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-500/40 to-transparent rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"relative w-full h-full bg-white border border-brand-100/50 backdrop-blur-sm\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-1/2 h-1/5 relative p-[1px] rounded-sm\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-500/50 to-transparent rounded-sm\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"relative w-full h-full bg-white border border-brand-100/50 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-[0_-10px_30px_rgba(20,184,166,0.1)]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- PAGE 4: PRINCIPLES -->\n            <section class=\"bg-white rounded-sm shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden aspect-[1/1.4] min-h-[600px] flex flex-col animate-fade-in-up\" style=\"animation: fade-in-up 0.8s ease-out 0.5s forwards; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-[35%] w-[1px] bg-slate-100 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex h-full relative z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"w-[35%] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-brand-500 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase leading-tight\">Rules of<br>Engagement</h3>\n                        <div class=\"mt-auto text-[10px] text-slate-400 leading-tight\">\n                            Aura exists to enforce consistency across distributed platforms.\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"w-[65%] p-8 pt-24 relative\">\n                        <span class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium\">02</span>\n\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-8\">\n                            <li class=\"group\">\n                                <h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-brand-500 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                                    Function over form\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 leading-relaxed pl-3 border-l border-transparent group-hover:border-brand-200 transition-colors\">\n                                    Every visual element must serve a functional purpose. We eliminate decorative noise to elevate clarity.\n                                </p>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"group\">\n                                <h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-brand-500 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                                    Scalable by default\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 leading-relaxed pl-3 border-l border-transparent group-hover:border-brand-200 transition-colors\">\n                                    Components are designed in isolation but built to integrate seamlessly into complex macro-layouts.\n                                </p>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"group\">\n                                <h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-brand-500 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                                    Restrained motion\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 leading-relaxed pl-3 border-l border-transparent group-hover:border-brand-200 transition-colors\">\n                                    Animation is a structural tool to guide attention and explain spatial relationships, never for entertainment.\n                                </p>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n             <!-- PAGE 5: COLORS -->\n             <section class=\"bg-white rounded-sm shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden aspect-[1/1.4] min-h-[600px] flex flex-col animate-fade-in-up\" style=\"animation: fade-in-up 0.8s ease-out 0.6s forwards; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-[35%] w-[1px] bg-slate-100 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex h-full relative z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"w-[35%] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-brand-500 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase leading-tight\">Palette<br>System</h3>\n                        <div class=\"mt-auto text-[10px] text-slate-400 leading-tight\">\n                            Color in Aura is functional, dictating state and hierarchy.\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"w-[65%] p-6 flex flex-col relative\">\n                         <span class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium\">03</span>\n\n                        <div class=\"mt-12 space-y-6\">\n                            <!-- Primary Colors -->\n                            <div>\n                                <h4 class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 font-medium\">Primary Range</h4>\n                                <div class=\"flex h-32 rounded-sm overflow-hidden\">\n                                    <!-- Using inline styles for exact hex matching the reference's strict color stack approach -->\n                                    <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-brand-900 text-white text-[8px] p-1 flex items-end\">900</div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-brand-500 text-white text-[8px] p-1 flex items-end\">500</div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-[#2dd4bf] text-white text-[8px] p-1 flex items-end\">400</div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-[#5eead4] text-slate-800 text-[8px] p-1 flex items-end\">300</div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-[#99f6e4] text-slate-800 text-[8px] p-1 flex items-end\">200</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-slate-900 text-white text-[8px] p-1 flex items-end\">900</div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-slate-700 text-white text-[8px] p-1 flex items-end\">700</div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-slate-500 text-white text-[8px] p-1 flex items-end\">500</div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-slate-300 text-slate-800 text-[8px] p-1 flex items-end\">300</div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 text-[8px] p-1 flex items-end\">100</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Neutral Base -->\n                            <div>\n                                <h4 class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 font-medium\">Core Surfaces</h4>\n                                <div class=\"flex h-16 rounded-sm overflow-hidden border border-slate-100\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex-1 bg-brand-950 text-white text-[8px] p-1 flex items-end justify-between\">\n                                        <span>Dark Base</span>\n                                        <span class=\"opacity-50\">#042F2E</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"flex-1 bg-white text-slate-800 text-[8px] p-1 flex items-end justify-between border-l border-slate-100\">\n                                        <span>Light Base</span>\n                                        <span class=\"opacity-50\">#FFFFFF</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Custom inline styles for keyframes to avoid external CSS requirements while keeping complex animations -->\n    <style>\n        @keyframes fade-in-up {\n            0% {\n                opacity: 0;\n                transform: translateY(20px);\n            }\n            100% {\n                opacity: 1;\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Initialization Script -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('hero-canvas');\n            if (!canvas || !window.THREE) return;\n\n            // Scene setup\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, canvas.clientWidth / canvas.clientHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas: canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n\n            renderer.setSize(canvas.clientWidth, canvas.clientHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            // Create abstract particle grid\n            const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const count = 300; // number of points\n            const positions = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < count * 3; i++) {\n                // creating a localized cluster/cloud\n                positions[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10;\n            }\n\n            geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(positions, 3));\n\n            // Material matching the brand color\n            const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.05,\n                color: 0x14b8a6, // Brand-500 Teal\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.6,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const particles = new THREE.Points(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(particles);\n\n            // Connect close particles with lines to simulate a \"system/network\"\n            const lineMaterial = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0x14b8a6,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.15\n            });\n\n            const lineGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const linePositions = [];\n\n            // Brute force connection for simplicity in this constrained environment\n            const posAttr = geometry.getAttribute('position');\n            for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n                for (let j = i + 1; j < count; j++) {\n                    const dx = posAttr.getX(i) - posAttr.getX(j);\n                    const dy = posAttr.getY(i) - posAttr.getY(j);\n                    const dz = posAttr.getZ(i) - posAttr.getZ(j);\n                    const distSq = dx*dx + dy*dy + dz*dz;\n\n                    if (distSq < 2.5) { // connect if close\n                        linePositions.push(\n                            posAttr.getX(i), posAttr.getY(i), posAttr.getZ(i),\n                            posAttr.getX(j), posAttr.getY(j), posAttr.getZ(j)\n                        );\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            lineGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(linePositions, 3));\n            const lines = new THREE.LineSegments(lineGeometry, lineMaterial);\n            scene.add(lines);\n\n            camera.position.z = 4;\n            camera.position.x = 2; // offset to fit the layout\n\n            // Mouse interaction logic\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            let targetX = 0;\n            let targetY = 0;\n            const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n            const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX);\n                mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY);\n            });\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                targetX = mouseX * 0.001;\n                targetY = mouseY * 0.001;\n\n                particles.rotation.y += 0.002;\n                particles.rotation.x += 0.001;\n\n                lines.rotation.y += 0.002;\n                lines.rotation.x += 0.001;\n\n                // Subtle wave effect based on time\n                const positions = particles.geometry.attributes.position.array;\n                for(let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n                    const i3 = i * 3;\n                    const x = positions[i3];\n                    // gently oscillate y based on x and time\n                    positions[i3 + 1] += Math.sin(elapsedTime + x) * 0.002;\n                }\n                particles.geometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = canvas.clientWidth / canvas.clientHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(canvas.clientWidth, canvas.clientHeight);\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aura-design-system.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/aura-design-system.jpg", "source_name": "aura-design-system-DESIGN.md", "views": 209, "forks": 16, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T13:17:02.318435+00:00"}